    "moka_reviews": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "moka_rev_2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>We spent so much money trying different bottles—Pigeon, Comotomo, Dr. Brown's, and a few others. None of them felt quite right for our little one. Hosfu costs a bit more, but looking back, buying it first would have saved us both money and a lot of trial and error.</p>",
            "author": "James Madders ✅"
          }
        },
        "moka_rev_3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Our baby struggled with gas after almost every bottle, so feeding time was never relaxing. Hosfu has been the first bottle that's made a noticeable difference. Feeding feels calmer now, and she's no longer swallowing nearly as much air.</p>",
            "author": "Sharrah Carter ✅"
          }
        },
        "moka_rev_4": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 4,
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>We needed a bottle that could make the transition between breastfeeding and bottle-feeding feel less stressful. Hosfu’s nipple shape helped my baby latch much more naturally, and feeds now feel smoother instead of turning into a struggle every time.</p>",
            "author": "Jelline Coleman ✅"
          }
        },
        "moka_rev_5": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>What I love most is how simple the bottle is to use. There are no tiny tubes or complicated pieces to scrub after every feed. It comes apart quickly, cleans easily, and still feels secure enough to carry in my diaper bag without worrying about leaks.</p>",
            "author": "Rachel Morgan ✅"
          }
        },
        "moka_rev_6": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>The glass feels sturdy and premium, and I feel better knowing the milk is not sitting against plastic. We have warmed and sterilized the bottle repeatedly, and it still looks clear and holds up beautifully. Hosfu has become the bottle we reach for first.</p>",
            "author": "Lauren Davis ✅"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "moka_rev_2",
        "moka_rev_3",
        "moka_rev_4",
        "moka_rev_5",
        "moka_rev_6"
      ],
