    "moka_faq": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "moka_faq_1": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "What makes the Hosfu bottle different?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Hosfu combines a high-borosilicate glass body, a breast-shaped silicone nipple, and a bottom vent system in one simple design. It is made to support a more natural latch, reduce swallowed air, and make cleaning easier with fewer parts.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_2": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Will Hosfu completely prevent gas or colic?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>No bottle can guarantee that a baby will never experience gas or colic. Hosfu is designed to reduce swallowed air and support calmer, more comfortable feeds, but every baby is different.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_3": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Is the nipple suitable for breastfed babies?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Moka uses a wide, 15° naturally-shaped nipple to support a deeper latch, but no bottle can guarantee acceptance for every baby.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_4": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How do I know if the nipple flow is too fast?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Coughing, gulping, pulling away, fussing, or milk leaking from the mouth may indicate that the flow is too fast. Try moving down to a slower nipple level.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_5": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "What materials are used?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The bottle body is made from high-borosilicate glass. The nipple is made from platinum-cured silicone, while the cap and screw ring are made from BPA-free PPSU.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_6": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Does the milk touch plastic?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The main milk chamber is made from high-borosilicate glass, so milk rests against glass rather than a plastic bottle body.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_7": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Can I sterilize the bottle?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. The bottle can be sterilized by boiling, steaming, or using a UV sterilizer. Always follow the instructions provided with your sterilizing equipment.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_8": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Can I wash it in the dishwasher?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The glass bottle may be placed on the top rack when dishwasher cleaning is permitted by the care instructions. Hand-washing the silicone and PPSU components is recommended to help extend their lifespan.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_9": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Will it fit my pump?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Pump compatibility depends on the pump and adapter. Please confirm compatibility for your specific pump before use.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_10": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Can I microwave the bottle?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>We do not recommend microwaving the bottle. Microwaves can heat milk unevenly and create hot spots. Use a bottle warmer or place the bottle in warm water instead.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_11": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "When will my order ship?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Hosfu comes with a 90-day money-back guarantee. Try it during real feeding routines, and if it is not the right fit for your baby, return it according to the store’s return conditions.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "moka_faq_12": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "What's the guarantee?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Hosfu comes with a 90-day money-back guarantee. Try it during real feeding routines, and if it is not the right fit for your baby, return it according to the store’s return conditions.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
